// App Service plan SKU description
//
// The billable SKU an App Service plan runs on, together with the feature
// flags and scaling limits Azure reports for it. The tier decides which
// platform security features the plan can offer, among them VNet integration,
// private endpoints and IP restrictions, so it is read alongside the app
// settings that depend on them.
private azure.subscription.webService.appServicePlan.skuDescription @defaults("name tier capacity") {
  // SKU name, for example "P1v3", "S1", or "Y1"
  name string
