// Azure Monitor action group
//
// A named set of notification and automation targets that alert rules
// fire when they trigger: emails, SMS messages, voice calls, webhooks,
// Azure Functions, Logic Apps, automation runbooks, and ITSM
// connectors. Surfaces whether the group is enabled and each configured
// receiver, so audits can confirm that critical alerts actually reach a
// responder. Select by the action group's Azure resource ID.
private azure.subscription.monitorService.actionGroup @defaults("name groupShortName enabled") {
  // ARM resource ID
  id string
  // Action group name
  name string
