// Azure Event Grid event subscription
//
// Delivery rule attached to a topic, system topic, or domain: it decides
// which events are forwarded and, more importantly, where they go. The
// `destinationType` and `destinationEndpoint` fields name the sink, which
// is the question an audit asks of event routing, because a webhook
// pointing outside the tenant is an egress path for whatever the source
