// Azure Service Fabric
//
// Service Fabric clusters across the subscription. The `clusters`
// field lists every cluster resource, each exposing the management
// endpoint clients connect to, the runtime version and upgrade
// posture, and the authentication settings that decide who may
// administer it: Entra ID (Azure Active Directory) integration, the
// cluster and client certificates, and the node types that publish
